        "topicId": "conversations.talk",
        "title": "Join and Use Compass Talk",
        "summary": "Authorized internal staff can open Talk and check the private setup screen before choosing Join meeting . Use Preview camera , Test microphone , and the device selectors to verify the right equipment. The preview stays private until joining. Background choices include Off, Blur with adjustable strength, and personal background images. Stronger background cleanup hides uncertain edges but can trim fine hair or details; check the preview. Uploaded personal backgrounds can be removed with confirmation.",
        "content": "Authorized internal staff can open **Talk** and check the private setup screen before choosing **Join meeting**. Use **Preview camera**, **Test microphone**, and the device selectors to verify the right equipment. The preview stays private until joining. Background choices include Off, Blur with adjustable strength, and personal background images. **Stronger background cleanup** hides uncertain edges but can trim fine hair or details; check the preview. Uploaded personal backgrounds can be removed with confirmation.\n\nDuring a call, use the microphone and camera controls, screen sharing, **Background & Settings**, and picture-in-picture when supported by the browser. **Show Notes & Transcript** opens the side panel; hiding it keeps the current tab, draft notes, and capture state. Save notes with the provided control before leaving. Resizing the window keeps call controls accessible.\n\nRead the call's recovery message when a device fails. Check browser and operating-system permission, choose **System default** or another device, then use **Try again** or **Try alternate microphone method** when offered. If the background cannot start, choose Off or join without video. **Leave** exits only your session; **End for Everyone** is available only when your meeting role permits it. Review the exit confirmation before continuing."
