        "content": "Ask **Jarvis** which conversations have unread messages, to summarize recent messages, or to find a phrase in channels you can see. Its built-in conversation tools read channels and messages; they do not send or edit them. Use the links in the answer to verify context and respond in the appropriate workspace. See [Ask Jarvis](/dashboard/help/ask-jarvis) for the full capability guide."
