        "summary": "On work days, staff who haven't written a daily log get a reminder at the company's time: one for office staff and one for field staff. A log on any job or workspace, or time entered on the duty log, counts. People on an Absence on the work calendar are skipped. Tapping the reminder opens a new log on the job you were scheduled on, or where you last logged.",
        "content": "On work days, staff who haven't written a daily log get a reminder at the company's time: one for office staff and one for field staff. A log on any job or workspace, or time entered on the duty log, counts. People on an Absence on the work calendar are skipped. Tapping the reminder opens a new log on the job you were scheduled on, or where you last logged.\n\nWhen the company allows it, you can choose your own reminder time in **Settings → Preferences**. Admins see who didn't log on the last work day on their dashboard, and the last five work days under **Office alerts → Missing daily logs**. Admins set the times, work days and who is reminded in **Settings → Workflows → Daily logs**."
